## Phase 01 (visitor-spike) complete

**What was done:**
1. **Built & ran** `crates/oxc_spike/` — a throwaway binary that exercised every OXC API assumed by phases 3/4/6. All assertions passed. Spike then deleted.
2. **Created** `NOTES.swc-to-oxc-migration.01-visitor-spike.md` with confirmed/corrected bullets for all 15 items.

**Key corrections found (vs original plan assumptions):**

| Item | Correction |
|---|---|
